# Every environment variable Hearth reads, each with a comment saying what it's for. Copy this
# file to .env (git-ignored) for local development and fill in the values; real secrets never go
# in this file.
#
# Server-only variables never start with VITE_: Vite builds VITE_* variables into the browser
# bundle.
#
